OL,3,GNEWSAMan begins 100-mile run for
OL,4,Ameningitis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire man has set off on a
OL,7,F100-mile run to Anfield, home of
OL,8,FLiverpool FC, to raise awareness for
OL,9,Fmeningitis B.
OL,11,FShaun McEntee, who only completed his
OL,12,Ffirst half marathon last year, started
OL,13,Fhis journey at Kidderminster Harriers
OL,14,FFC's Aggborough Stadium on Wednesday
OL,15,Fmorning, aiming to raise #5,000 for
OL,16,FMeningitis Now.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
