OL,3,GNEWSAMan begins 100-mile run for
OL,4,Ameningitis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the death of family
OL,7,Ffriend and Liverpool fan Aaron Mills,
OL,8,Fwho died from meningitis in January in
OL,9,FKidderminster during a break from his
OL,10,Fstudies at Liverpool John Moores
OL,11,FUniversity.
OL,13,F"I'll get through one way or another,
OL,14,FMcEntee said, adding: "There's too much
OL,15,Fsupport, there's too many people that
OL,16,FI'd be letting down if I [don't]."
